        <message_html><![CDATA[<div>
<p><img title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="baseline" border="" hspace="" vspace="" /></p>
</div>
<div><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE</span></div>
<div>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"><em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em> </a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<div><strong>Please do not reply to this email. The system cannot receive messages.</strong></div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Investigation complete: Employee Workplace Incident Reporting</span></div>
</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Please be advised that the workplace health and safety committee or the health and safety representative has completed their investigation for the following case <strong>${number}.</strong></p>
</div>
<div>
<p>Please ensure to view the WHSC/HSR recommendations and comments under the WHSC tab as further action may be required..</p>
<p>If required, you may consult your OHS Advisor for further support.</p>
<p>Please click the link below to view this case.&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="${mail_script:x_hccc_hoc_ohs_inv_case_link}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">link</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<p>Occupational Health and Safety Management System</p>
<p>OHSMS</p>
</div>
<div>
<p>_______________________________________________________________________________</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span id="francais" style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<div><strong>Pri&egrave;re de ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d&rsquo;une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></div>
<p><span style="color: #99cc00; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 8pt;"><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Enqu&ecirc;te requise : Rapport d'incident sur le lieu de travail des employ&eacute;s</span></span></span></p>
<div>
<p>Bonjour,</p>
<p>Veuillez noter que le comit&eacute; de sant&eacute; et de s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail ou le d&eacute;l&eacute;gu&eacute; &agrave; la sant&eacute; et &agrave; la s&eacute;curit&eacute; a termin&eacute; son enqu&ecirc;te pour le cas suivant<span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">&nbsp;<strong>${number}</strong> .</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p>Veuillez vous assurer de consulter les recommandations et les commentaires du WHSC/HSR sous l'onglet WHSC car d'autres mesures peuvent &ecirc;tre n&eacute;cessaires.</p>
<p>Si n&eacute;cessaire, vous pouvez consulter votre conseiller en SST pour une assistance suppl&eacute;mentaire.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p>Veuillez cliquer sur le lien ci-dessous pour visualiser et traiter ce cas.&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="${mail_script:x_hccc_hoc_ohs_inv_case_link}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">lien</a></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">Merci,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p>Syst&egrave;me de gestion de la sant&eacute; et de la s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail</p>
<p>SGSST</p>
</div>
</div>]]></message_html>
